{"id":"384b2c965aebdc18","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-cor-cofinality.md","title":"Cofinality Corollary","display":"cor-cofinality — Cofinality Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-cofinality","aliases":["58-cor-cofinality"],"display":"cor-cofinality — Cofinality Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-cofinality — Cofinality Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (正则基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (共尾数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\)</span>；上述箭头为可定义类函数记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Regular cardinals have cofinality equal to themselves.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_0) = \\aleph_0\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_0) = \\aleph_0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_1) = \\aleph_1\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_1) = \\aleph_1\\)</span>, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (正则基数谓词, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ (共尾数函数, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_0) = \\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_1) = \\aleph_1","display":false}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-cor-cofinality.md|58-cor-cofinality]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","0fbfc19800246e77"]}